Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] seam: trusted completion fence for async delegation
 (experimental)

tools/async_delegation.py: a plugin-registered guard validates a
"completion_fence" before a background completion is delivered, including
orphan replay after restart; the gateway passes the fence when it claims a
completion. Prevents delivery of stale or unreviewed results.

Experimental, built against Hermes 8a3ede1b.
